01:11:24,000 --> 01:11:30,000
Not Without Hope is a 2025 survival thriller film directed by Joe Carnahan and starring Zachary Levi as Nick Schuyler, the real-life
sole survivor of a 2009 boating accident that took the lives of NFL football players Marquis Cooper and Corey Smith.

10
01:19:20,000 --> 01:19:26,000
The screenplay was written by E.

11
01:27:16,000 --> 01:27:22,000
Nicholas Mariani and Joe Carnahan and is based on Schuyler and Jeré
Longman's 2010 nonfiction book of the same title.

12
01:35:12,000 --> 01:35:18,000
The film premiered at Austin Film Festival on October 25, 2025,
and was released in theaters on December 12.

13
01:43:08,000 --> 01:43:14,000
The film explores themes of sentimental, defiant, tragic.

14
